		<Row Tag="LOC_CQ_MOD_TITLE" Language="en_US"><Text>Civilization Conquest Mode</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_CQ_MOD_TEASER" Language="en_US"><Text>Capture a rival's original capital to adopt their civilization and leader abilities and unique units, buildings, districts and improvements.</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_CQ_MOD_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US"><Text>Adds the Civilization Conquest game mode. When a civilization's original capital is under your control, you may activate that civilization's ability, its leader's ability and its unique units, buildings, districts and improvements from a new Launch Bar screen.</Text></Row>

		<Row Tag="LOC_GAMEMODE_CIV_CONQUEST_NAME" Language="en_US"><Text>Civilization Conquest Mode</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_GAMEMODE_CIV_CONQUEST_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US"><Text>Conquer to inherit. Capturing a major civilization's original capital lets you activate its civilization ability, leader ability and unique units, buildings, districts and improvements. Open the Conquest screen from the Launch Bar at the top left.</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_CQ_OPTION_AI_AUTO_NAME" Language="en_US"><Text>Conquest: AI Auto-Activates</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_CQ_OPTION_AI_AUTO_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US"><Text>When an AI captures an original capital, it automatically activates everything from that civilization.</Text></Row>

		<Row Tag="LOC_CQ_LAUNCHBAR_TOOLTIP" Language="en_US"><Text>Civilization Conquest</Text></Row>
